 use toys, unlock hats, collect coins, and create chaotic moments around the room. Throw a banana peel, spray a water gun, play with a ball, try different foods, and watch the characters react in funny ways.\n\nThe game is designed for short, energetic VR sessions with simple gameplay, bright cartoon visuals, and playful comedy.\n\nFeatures:\n- Funny VR tag gameplay\n- Colorful daycare playroom environment\n- Mischievous kids and a dramatic grandma\n- Banana pranks, water gun chaos, balls, toys, and surprises\n- Unlockable hats and player customization\n- Food items that change character face textures\n- Coins, achievements, and replayable challenges\n- Short sessions made for quick VR fun\n\nKids Chaos VR is a family-friendly comedy-style VR game designed for teens and adults who enjoy lighthearted chaos, silly interactions, and playful sandbox moments. please. I really need it. Please leave your feedback.", "short_description": "A funny VR daycare chaos game with tag, toys, pranks, hats, coins, and one very dramatic grandma."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bloodhunterage.wordpress.com/kids-chaos-vr-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Andris Games", "support_website_url": "https://bloodhunterage.wordpress.com/kids-chaos-vr-support/", "website_url": "https://bloodhunterage.wordpress.com/kids-chaos-vr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": [